{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b3c9356baf495bc8","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9014-E001\n3\ttitle: GA-readiness assessment for Llama Stack\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9014\n5\tcomponent: Llama Stack\n6\tteam: RHOAI GenAI\n7\ttype: Investigation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tdependencies: []\n10\tinvestigation_signals:\n11\t  question_specificity: 1\n12\t  source_accessibility: 0\n13\t  local_runnability: 0\n14\t  cluster_hardware_dependence: -1\n15\t  human_judgment_required: -1\n16\timplementation_type: null\n17\tai_signals: null\n18\tai_implementability: Low\n19\tai_implementability_score: -1\n20\tjira_key: null\n21\tbranch: null\n22\tgated_by: null\n23\tgate_failure_impact: null\n24\t---\n25\t# GA-readiness assessment for Llama Stack\n26\t\n27\t## Description\n28\t\n29\tThis epic resolves the strategy's central unknown: the full inventory of gaps\n30\tbetween current Llama Stack Tech Preview quality and the GA bar. It produces\n31\tthe definitive GA scope that all downstream GA work is planned against. The\n32\tassessment consolidates scattered TP feedback (support tickets, known issues)\n33\tand systematically evaluates the four gap dimensions named by the strategy:\n34\tAPI stability, upgrade paths, scale limits, and error handling.\n35\t\n36\t## Scope\n37\t\n38\t- Consolidate and triage TP feedback from support tickets and other feedback\n39\t  channels into a single deduplicated inventory.\n40\t- Audit the published API surface (OpenAI-compatible REST APIs and the\n41\t  LlamaStackDistribution CRD) for stability gaps: unversioned or\n42\t  churn-prone endpoints, undocumented behaviors, breaking changes across\n43\t  recent TP releases.\n44\t- Assess upgrade paths: what is required to upgrade from the last two TP\n45\t  releases, including whether upgrade-test infrastructure exists.\n46\t- Assess scale limits: current known ceilings (concurrent distributions,\n47\t  request throughput, r